/P 103 0 R
/E (It is with great pleasure that I extend my heartfelt greetings to the talented members of our Computer Science and Engineering family. As we embark on another academic journey, I am filled with pride and enthusiasm for the remarkable achievements and unwavering dedication that define our CSE department.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
272 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (In the ever-evolving landscape of technology, our CSE department continues to be a beacon of excellence. Our students, faculty, and staff contribute tirelessly to the dynamic field of computer science, pushing boundaries and shaping the future.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
273 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (The collective brilliance within these walls is not only inspiring but also a testament to our commitment to fostering innovation, collaboration, and a relentless pursuit of knowledge.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
274 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (I commend the initiative to showcase the department's achievements through this magazine, "Prisma 3.0". Let the pages within be a reflection of our shared journey, celebrating successes, acknowledging challenges, and highlighting the collective spirit that defines us. I encourage everyone to actively participate and contribute to making this edition a true representation of the outstanding work emanating from our CSE family.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
