<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (Technology can be a powerful medium to transform our world, but its true significance emerges through curiosity, empathy, and creativity. As followers and learners of Computer Science, logic forms the foundation of our thinking, but the true impact of our innovations also depends on our character and human values.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
297 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (Beyond algorithms and code, we should strive to develop the art of storytelling, adaptability, and ethical leadership in every step of life. Outside the classroom, PRISMA 3.0 serves as a wonderful platform to showcase our artistic talents, unique perspectives, and creativity.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
298 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (May your code remain clean, but your thoughts be far-reaching, and may your curiosity and passion for learning something new never fade.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
