532 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E ( AI could have predicted ways to reduce cost and to improve product quality. In old systems  maintenance cost was also too high. Machines often broke down due to several reasons. AI could have prevented these things if it existed. Sometimes companies feared to take risks for producing huge amounts of products .AI could have predicted what can happen if the risk was taken , so that companies could invest to produce large amounts of products calculating the probability.  Production would also become faster with the help of AI. But as works get easier , companies would need fewer people for work , so unemployment would be higher because of these , which is now visible in 21st century. People are facing huge number of layoffs in companies. If AI was there in 19th century improvement would happen earlier but this modern automation fear would also have been started earlier Now coming to medicine and healthcare . AI could have predicted the possibility of outbreaks of disease earlier.  Many people could have survived pandemics and epidemics if people had known about them earlier. Even it could have suggested preventive measures of that pandemic or epidemic or ways to defeat them. Better ways of sanitization would be suggested by AI. So that the outbreak of deadly diseases in the 19th and 20th century like plague and dengue might not have happened. Because of this mortality rates would be reduced significantly. Today AI is used in detecting diseases from x-rays, MRI scans, and reports, predicting health risk and patient condition, discovering and testing new medicines , assisting in robotic surgeries and in many fields. Maybe AI could not do so many things in those early days but even if there was a primitive form of AI  in those days, the medical field would have been much more developed today.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
533 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (AI could have had a great impact on the historical wars and colonialism that we read about in history books today.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
534 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E ( Maybe the history would have changed if AI existed. AI-assisted military systems and strategies could have changed the history. It could help detect or predict enemy plans, analysing possible outcomes of steps taken. Besides these many things like tracking enemy camps and immediately sending alerts if any movement was noticed \(auto surveillance system\) could have emerged on those days. Faster communication in the time of needs could have existed. Many propaganda on those days were created to provoke normal persons by foreign powers and even by the rulers on the subjects. Which had affected history very much. AI could analyse those things and the true intentions behind them. Because of these the entire history of colonialism would have been changed.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
535 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E ( Scientific discoveries would also be helped by AI in various ways. Even science would be much more developed today if AI existed earlier. AI could have helped scientists to recognise patterns, predict outcomes of certain experiments , make calculations easier. Often in past scientists overlook a thing which really mattered for that experiment, AI could warn them about such things. In many cases they have to wait for a very long time to get the outcome. AI could have predicted the outcomes earlier by prediction, early pattern analysis and some complex mathematical problems. If great scientists like Nikola Tesla, Charles Darwin, Gregor Mendel and many more had received the benefit of AI at that time, they could publish their research earlier. Which would open countless new possibilities to make new discoveries.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
